WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.694
<b>I arrived</b> at the airport at seven o'clock.

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:11.743
<b>I didn’t arrive</b> at the airport at seven o'clock.

00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:18.400
<b>You finished</b> the book.

00:00:21.572 --> 00:00:23.429
<b>You didn’t finish</b> the book.

00:00:26.578 --> 00:00:27.953
<b>He wanted</b> a coffee.

00:00:30.994 --> 00:00:32.603
<b>He didn’t want</b> a coffee.

00:00:35.703 --> 00:00:37.167
<b>She liked</b> the film.

00:00:40.246 --> 00:00:42.306
<b>She didn’t like</b> the film.

00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:46.819
<b>It rained</b> yesterday.

00:00:49.871 --> 00:00:51.552
<b>It didn’t rain</b> yesterday.

00:00:54.626 --> 00:00:56.951
<b>We studied</b> Spanish at school.

00:01:00.009 --> 00:01:02.901
<b>We didn’t study</b> Spanish at school.

00:01:05.959 --> 00:01:07.637
<b>They stopped</b> at a cafe.

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.735
<b>They didn’t stop</b> at a cafe.

00:01:15.786 --> 00:01:17.818
<b>Did you watch TV</b> yesterday?

00:01:20.893 --> 00:01:22.119
Yes, <b>I did</b>.

00:01:25.226 --> 00:01:26.522
No, <b>I didn’t</b>.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:31.090
<b>Did she walk</b> to work?

00:01:34.134 --> 00:01:35.369
Yes, <b>she did</b>.

00:01:38.462 --> 00:01:39.690
No, <b>she didn’t</b>.

00:01:42.774 --> 00:01:44.077
<b>Did they play</b> tennis?

00:01:47.136 --> 00:01:48.370
Yes, <b>they did</b>.

00:01:51.437 --> 00:01:52.770
No, <b>they didn’t</b>.